{"id":"H0275","lemma":"אֲחֻזָּם","transliteration":"achuzzam","sayIt":"a-chuz-ZAM","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Ahuzzam","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ch.4.6;\nson of: Ashhur (H0806) and Naarah (H5292B);\nbrother of: Hepher (H2660), Temeni (H8488) and Haahashtari (H0326);\nhalf-brother of: Zereth (H6889), Izhar (H3328), Ethnan (H0869) and Koz (H6976)\n§ Ahuzam = \"possessor\"\na descendant of Judah through Caleb","glosses":["ahuzzam"],"count":1,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-4","v":6,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ahuzzam","kjv":"him Ahuzam"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 4:6","note":"Naarah bore him Ahuzzam, Hepher, Temeni, and Haahashtari. These were the sons of Naarah.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0806","lemma":"אַשְׁחוּר","transliteration":"ashchur","gloss":"Ashhur"},{"id":"H5292","lemma":"נַעֲרָה","transliteration":"naarah","gloss":"Naarah"},{"id":"H2660","lemma":"חֵ֫פֶר","transliteration":"chepher","gloss":"Hepher"},{"id":"H8488","lemma":"תֵּימְנִי","transliteration":"temeni","gloss":"Temeni"},{"id":"H0326","lemma":"אֲחַשְׁתָּרִי","transliteration":"achashtari","gloss":"Haahashtari"},{"id":"H6889","lemma":"צֶ֫רֶת","transliteration":"tseret","gloss":"Zereth"},{"id":"H3328","lemma":"יִצְחַר","transliteration":"yitschar","gloss":"Izhar"},{"id":"H0869","lemma":"אֶתְנַן","transliteration":"etnan","gloss":"Ethnan"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}